{"speciesId":312,"names":{"fr":"Négapi","es":"Minun","en":"Minun","ja":"マイナン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MINUN is more concerned about cheering on its partners than its own safety. It shorts out the electricity in its body to create brilliant showers of sparks to cheer on its teammates."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MINUN loves to cheer on its partner in battle. It gives off sparks from its body while it is doing so. If its partner is in trouble, this POKéMON gives off increasing amounts of sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"At a meeting of POKéMON academics, it was announced that simultaneous exposure to electricity from a PLUSLE and MINUN will promote circulation and boost vitality."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its dislike of water makes it take shelter under the eaves of houses in rain. It uses pom-poms made of sparks for cheering."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its dislike of water makes it take shelter under the eaves of houses in rain. It uses pom-poms made of sparks for cheering."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Exposure to electricity from MINUN and PLUSLE promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Exposure to electricity from MINUN and PLUSLE promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il encourage ses amis. Son corps produit plus d’étincelles quand il est en mauvaise posture."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il encourage ses amis. Son corps produit plus d’étincelles quand il est en mauvaise posture."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"L’électricité de Posipi et Négapi favorise la circulation sanguine et guérit les courbatures."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La electricidad de Minun y Plusle es buena para la circulación y para desentumecer músculos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Exposure to electricity from Minun and Plusle promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"マイナンと プラスルの 電気は 血液の 流れを 良くして こりを ほぐす 効果が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il encourage ses amis. Son corps produit plus d’étincelles quand il est en mauvaise posture."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le gusta animar a sus amigos. Si pierden, su cuerpo suelta cada vez más chispas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"仲間を 応援する 習性。 負けそうになると 体から 出す 火花の 数が どんどん 増える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Négapi n’hésite pas à se mettre en danger pour soutenir ses partenaires. Il court-circuite son corps pour faire jaillir des gerbes d’étincelles et donner du cœur à l’ouvrage à ses équipiers."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Minun se preocupa más por alentar a sus compañeros de equipo que por su propia seguridad. Para animar a los miembros de su grupo, crea un cortocircuito en su interior y libera un chisporroteo espectacular."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Minun is more concerned about cheering on its partners than its own safety. It shorts out the electricity in its body to create brilliant showers of sparks to cheer on its teammates."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"自分よりも 仲間の 応援が 大事。 体から 発する 電気を ショートさせて 派手に 火花を 出しながら 応援するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Négapi adore encourager son partenaire pendant les combats. Des étincelles jaillissent alors de son corps. Lorsque son partenaire est en difficulté, le corps de ce Pokémon libère encore plus d’étincelles."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Minun empieza a echar chispas cuando está animando a su compañero en pleno combate. Si su compañero está en peligro, el chisporroteo aumenta su intensidad por momentos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Minun loves to cheer on its partner in battle. It gives off sparks from its body while it is doing so. If its partner is in trouble, this Pokémon gives off increasing amounts of sparks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"仲間の 応援が 大好きな ポケモン。 仲間が 負けそうに なると 体から 出る 火花の 数が どんどん 増えていくよ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":312,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-u